.TH teak 1  "teak 0.1.0" "teak manual"
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
teak \- Fit a large directory tree into a fixed line budget
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBteak\fR [\fB\-n\fR|\fB\-\-lines\fR] [\fB\-L\fR|\fB\-\-depth\fR] [\fB\-l\fR|\fB\-\-long\fR] [\fB\-\-sort\fR] [\fB\-\-focus\fR] [\fB\-\-series\-min\fR] [\fB\-\-detect\fR] [\fB\-\-preview\fR] [\fB\-\-dupes\fR] [\fB\-\-mismatches\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-cache\fR] [\fB\-\-templates\fR] [\fB\-\-templates\-only\fR] [\fB\-\-dump\-templates\fR] [\fB\-A\fR|\fB\-\-almost\-all\fR] [\fB\-a\fR|\fB\-\-all\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-gitignore\fR] [\fB\-\-chaff\fR] [\fB\-\-show\fR] [\fB\-\-fold\fR] [\fB\-\-hide\fR] [\fB\-x\fR|\fB\-\-one\-file\-system\fR] [\fB\-\-follow\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-\-json\-full\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-ascii\fR] [\fB\-\-width\fR] [\fB\-\-time\fR] [\fB\-\-bytes\fR] [\fB\-\-si\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-git\fR] [\fB\-\-why\fR] [\fB\-\-stats\fR] [\fB\-j\fR|\fB\-\-threads\fR] [\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIPATH\fR] 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Fit a large directory tree into a fixed line budget
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIPATH\fR]
Directories or files to show (default: the current directory)
.SH LAYOUT
.TP
\fB\-n\fR, \fB\-\-lines\fR \fI<N|auto>\fR
Line budget: a number (3 or more), or auto (terminal height \- 2) [default: 100]
.TP
\fB\-L\fR, \fB\-\-depth\fR \fI<N>\fR
Never open deeper than N
.TP
\fB\-l\fR, \fB\-\-long\fR
All columns (ls \-lah style)
.TP
\fB\-\-sort\fR \fI<KEY>\fR
Display order inside a directory
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
salience
.IP \(bu 2
name
.IP \(bu 2
size
.IP \(bu 2
age
.IP \(bu 2
type
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-focus\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Spend most of the budget on PATH, keep the context around it
.TP
\fB\-\-series\-min\fR \fI<N>\fR
Smallest group that becomes a series row [default: 4]
.SH CONTENT
.TP
\fB\-\-detect\fR \fI<MODE>\fR
Content detection [default: full]
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
off
.IP \(bu 2
fast
.IP \(bu 2
full
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-preview\fR \fI<MODE>\fR
Previews [default: short]
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
off
.IP \(bu 2
short
.IP \(bu 2
full
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-dupes\fR
Find duplicate files: fold copies of visible files
.TP
\fB\-\-mismatches\fR
List only files whose content does not match the extension
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-cache\fR
Do not read or write the type cache
.TP
\fB\-\-templates\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Add boilerplate templates from DIR (boilerplate/ and generated/)
.TP
\fB\-\-templates\-only\fR
Use only the templates from \-\-templates
.TP
\fB\-\-dump\-templates\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Write the built\-in templates to DIR and exit
.SH FILTERING
.TP
\fB\-A\fR, \fB\-\-almost\-all\fR
Show hidden entries (dotfiles, .git/), folded into the chaff line
.TP
\fB\-a\fR, \fB\-\-all\fR
Show everything: no chaff folding, no hidden entries, no gitignore
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-gitignore\fR
Do not use .gitignore rules
.TP
\fB\-\-chaff\fR \fI<LEVEL>\fR
Set the action for all chaff classes
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
show
.IP \(bu 2
dim
.IP \(bu 2
fold
.IP \(bu 2
hide
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-show\fR \fI<CLASS,…>\fR
Show these chaff classes as normal rows
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
vendor
.IP \(bu 2
build
.IP \(bu 2
cache
.IP \(bu 2
vcs
.IP \(bu 2
editor
.IP \(bu 2
lock
.IP \(bu 2
generated
.IP \(bu 2
minified
.IP \(bu 2
boilerplate
.IP \(bu 2
empty
.IP \(bu 2
duplicate
.IP \(bu 2
ignored
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-fold\fR \fI<CLASS,…>\fR
Fold these chaff classes into the chaff line
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
vendor
.IP \(bu 2
build
.IP \(bu 2
cache
.IP \(bu 2
vcs
.IP \(bu 2
editor
.IP \(bu 2
lock
.IP \(bu 2
generated
.IP \(bu 2
minified
.IP \(bu 2
boilerplate
.IP \(bu 2
empty
.IP \(bu 2
duplicate
.IP \(bu 2
ignored
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-hide\fR \fI<CLASS,…>\fR
Count these chaff classes only in the footer
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
vendor
.IP \(bu 2
build
.IP \(bu 2
cache
.IP \(bu 2
vcs
.IP \(bu 2
editor
.IP \(bu 2
lock
.IP \(bu 2
generated
.IP \(bu 2
minified
.IP \(bu 2
boilerplate
.IP \(bu 2
empty
.IP \(bu 2
duplicate
.IP \(bu 2
ignored
.RE
.TP
\fB\-x\fR, \fB\-\-one\-file\-system\fR
Do not cross into other file systems
.TP
\fB\-\-follow\fR
Follow symlinks
.SH OUTPUT
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FMT>\fR
Output format (default: tty on a terminal, else plain)
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
tty
.IP \(bu 2
plain
.IP \(bu 2
md
.IP \(bu 2
json
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-json\-full\fR
JSON with every entry (implies \-\-format json)
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR
Colors [default: auto]
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-ascii\fR
ASCII glyphs only
.TP
\fB\-\-width\fR \fI<N>\fR
Output width (default: the terminal width, or 120)
.TP
\fB\-\-time\fR \fI<MODE>\fR
Age format [default: relative]
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
relative
.IP \(bu 2
iso
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-bytes\fR
Sizes in whole bytes
.TP
\fB\-\-si\fR
Sizes in SI units (base 1000)
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-git\fR
No git status
.SH HELP
.TP
\fB\-\-why\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Explain the decision for PATH
.TP
\fB\-\-stats\fR
Print only the header, the type table, and the footer
.TP
\fB\-j\fR, \fB\-\-threads\fR \fI<N>\fR
Walk threads
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR
Print the version
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH FILES
.TP
\fI~/.config/teak/config.toml\fR
The user config. $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/teak/config.toml when XDG_CONFIG_HOME is set.
.TP
\fI.teak.toml\fR
The project config: the nearest one in the root or a parent directory.
Flags override the project file; the project file overrides the user file. Keys: lines, depth, sort, series_min, detect, preview, color, width, time, format, templates, [chaff] show/fold/hide, [[chaff.rules]] pattern and class, and [weights] size, recency, git, rarity, role, anomaly. A syntax error or a bad value exits with code 2; an unknown key is a warning.
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.TP
\fB0\fR
Success.
.TP
\fB1\fR
Success with errors: a missing root, or entries that teak cannot read.
.TP
\fB2\fR
A usage error: a bad flag value or a bad config file.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
\fBSOURCE_DATE_EPOCH\fR
The scan time, so relative ages and the output are fixed.
.TP
\fBNO_COLOR\fR
No colors, unless \-\-color always.
.TP
\fBCLICOLOR_FORCE\fR
Colors, also in a pipe.
.TP
\fBLS_COLORS\fR
The colors of the names.
.TP
\fBXDG_CACHE_HOME\fR
The type cache lives in its teak directory.
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
